DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
8282::$$$message_0059_0000_0000$$$::"Sorry for making you wait, Emiya."[lr]::
8283::$$$message_0059_0000_0001$$$::"Oh, I just finished too. Don't worry about it."[lr]::
8284::$$$message_0059_0000_0002$$$::"...Sorry. It's because freaking Mitsuzuri kept on extending the subject. Geez, there's no way I can approve of a kyudo club cake shop."::
8285::$$$message_0059_0001_0000$$$::"Haha. Fighting with Mitsuzuri, huh?[lr]::
8286::$$$message_0059_0001_0001$$$::What is the kyudo club gonna do?"[lr]::
8287::$$$message_0059_0001_0002$$$::"Mm? Apparently they're doing a parody of a family restaurant called Aluminum... No, An-something.[lr]::
8288::$$$message_0059_0001_0003$$$::Specializing in cakes sounds rather interesting, but unfortunately, we're at our limit for restaurant businesses. I'm sorry to the kyudo club, but they have to resubmit by the 11th."::
8289::$$$message_0059_0002_0000$$$::...So that's what happened...[lr]::
8290::$$$message_0059_0002_0001$$$::The kyudo club has it hard, but so does the student council president who has to deal with that.::
8291::$$$message_0059_0003_0000$$$::"Good job. Being a student council president is an unappreciated role that works outside school hours, huh, Issei."[lr]::
8292::$$$message_0059_0003_0001$$$::"What? I always work overtime on the mountain. This is nothing compared to that."[lr]::
8293::$$$message_0059_0003_0002$$$::I feel like his demeanor would be fit for some administrative position at some company instead of a temple.::
8294::$$$message_0059_0004_0000$$$::"What will you do, Emiya? Will you go straight home?"[lr]::
8295::$$$message_0059_0004_0001$$$::"Uh..."[lr]::
8296::$$$message_0059_0004_0002$$$::Come to think of it, we haven't gone home together recently.[lr]::
8297::$$$message_0059_0004_0003$$$::When we were first years, it was with either Shinji or Issei.[lr]::
8298::$$$message_0059_0004_0004$$$::With Shinji, it was to hang out, and with Issei, we had the same way home.::
8299::$$$message_0059_0005_0000$$$::"Nah, why don't we go to Shinto for the first time in a while, Issei?[lr]::
8300::$$$message_0059_0005_0001$$$::It's fine if you have to help out at home, though."[lr]::
8301::$$$message_0059_0005_0002$$$::"You also have a lot of mouths to feed; are you fine?"[lr]::
8302::$$$message_0059_0005_0003$$$::We worry about those around each other, but we aren't getting anywhere. Issei is looking over here with his usual expression.::
8303::$$$message_0059_0006_0000$$$::"There's no use in wasting time over a debate like this, let's go to Shinto."[lr]::
8304::$$$message_0059_0006_0001$$$::"Got it... What should we do?"::
8305::$$$message_0059_0007_0000$$$::"Maybe a movie... But it would take up too much time."[lr]::
8306::$$$message_0059_0007_0001$$$::"Hm, [font italic=true]NECOARC[font italic=false] or [font italic=true]Tiger Dojo: THE MOVIE[font italic=false]. Have you heard any reviews, Emiya?"[lr]::
8307::$$$message_0059_0007_0002$$$::"From what I've heard, they're both chaotic."[lr]::
8308::$$$message_0059_0007_0003$$$::"I see, comedies, huh?"[lr]::
8309::$$$message_0059_0007_0004$$$::"Apparently those who went to watch it themselves say tragedies, though."::
8310::$$$message_0059_0008_0000$$$::Hm, I wonder what we should do.[lr]::
8311::$$$message_0059_0008_0001$$$::We're both bad at the arcade, and something like the pool would be way out of the question.[lr]::
8312::$$$message_0059_0008_0002$$$::As I was thinking, Issei suggests something.::
8313::$$$message_0059_0009_0000$$$::"Emiya, I've been craving some sweets as I've been living in the mountains for a while. Is it okay if we go to Verde?"[lr]::
8314::$$$message_0059_0009_0001$$$::"Oh, they have a bookstore too. Why don't we go there?"[lr]::
8315::$$$message_0059_0009_0002$$$::We casually decide on the destination.[lr]::
8316::$$$message_0059_0009_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=一成02b(中)]We also were hanging around aimlessly in the past, so I guess this is fine. But for him to be deprived of sweets and meats, his life in the mountains must be tough.::
8317::$$$message_0059_0010_0000$$$::"Are you not going to buy any reference books or past exam collections?"[lr]::
8318::$$$message_0059_0010_0001$$$::"...Ah, I forgot about those things."[lr]::
8319::$$$message_0059_0010_0002$$$::We talk while looking at the magazines at the front of the bookstore.[lr]::
8320::$$$message_0059_0010_0003$$$::Things like reference books or study books are the model student Issei's forte.::
8321::$$$message_0059_0011_0000$$$::"Do you have any recommendations, Issei?"[lr]::
8322::$$$message_0059_0011_0001$$$::"I do, but... [cacheimage storage=一成03e(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=一成03e(中) textoff=0]I think I have recommended most of the reference books to you."[lr]::
8323::$$$message_0059_0011_0002$$$::That's right, Fuji-nee and Issei are the busybodies when it comes to those things. Tohsaka does care about my studies, but she always teaches me things about magecraft.::
8324::$$$message_0059_0012_0000$$$::"Geez, our other classmates are busy with cram schools or mock exams. In that sense, the way you talk without restraint makes me worried."[lr]::
8325::$$$message_0059_0012_0001$$$::"If only I was as smart as you... Oh, right. You're going to climb the mountain, huh."[lr]::
8326::$$$message_0059_0012_0002$$$::Yeah, I had heard about that.[lr]::
8327::$$$message_0059_0012_0003$$$::That he was going to train at Ryudou Temple after graduation. That's why he's fine with the insane situation of being student council president for three years.::
8328::$$$message_0059_0013_0000$$$::"Yes, it is my intention to wrap myself in a black robe, wishing humbly to protect the peace of sentient beings and live quietly in a hut."[lr]::
8329::$$$message_0059_0013_0001$$$::"What? A hut? Even though the temple is so big..."[lr]::
8330::$$$message_0059_0013_0002$$$::"Hey, I'm going to wish that all goes well for you. Just leave it up to me."[lr]::
8331::$$$message_0059_0013_0003$$$::Issei laughs joyfully.[lr]::
8332::$$$message_0059_0013_0004$$$::I can't tell where I'll be heading, but I'm relieved if my friend is praying for my safety.::
8333::$$$message_0059_0014_0000$$$::"I... Hmm, there's nothing to buy. What about you?"[lr]::
8334::$$$message_0059_0014_0001$$$::"Unfortunately, me neither. Let us head down then."[lr]::
8335::$$$message_0059_0014_0002$$$::"Oh yeah... There's like obanyaki and soft serve."[lr]::
8336::$$$message_0059_0014_0003$$$::There's an eating area on the side of the food section underground.[lr]::
8337::$$$message_0059_0014_0004$$$::Issei seems to like that spot... I wonder if he likes the feeling of hiding and eating.::
8338::$$$message_0059_0015_0000$$$::"Emiya, which obanyaki do you like?"[lr]::
8339::$$$message_0059_0015_0001$$$::"Whole red bean paste."[lr]::
8340::$$$message_0059_0015_0002$$$::"Hm, not a perfect answer, but you pass. [cacheimage storage=一成02a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=一成02a(中) textoff=0]Had you said cheese or custard, I would've had to give you a punishment and teach you the correct answer."::
8341::$$$message_0059_0016_0000$$$::Apparently, he's craving very specific sweets.[lr]::
8342::$$$message_0059_0016_0001$$$::I bet Issei would get mad if you made him eat a crepe.[lr]::
8343::$$$message_0059_0016_0002$$$::If it were Tohsaka, it'd be jam obanyaki or crazy stuff like that.::
8344::$$$message_0059_0017_0000$$$::"All right, I shall specially treat you to a red bean paste one."[lr]::
8345::$$$message_0059_0017_0001$$$::"I owe you one."[lr]::
8346::$$$message_0059_0017_0002$$$::If Issei climbs the mountain, I should bring him monaka, or bean jam-filled wafers...::
8347::$$$message_0059_0018_0000$$$::I put the obanyaki in a bag after all and head home while eating.[lr]::
8348::$$$message_0059_0018_0001$$$::It is a wonderful down-to-earth taste that doesn't put a dent in the wallet even when buying them as souvenirs.::
8349::$$$message_0059_0019_0000$$$::"That's right, Emiya. I will have you keep me company next week, too."[lr]::
8350::$$$message_0059_0019_0001$$$::"Would it be taiyaki or something this time?"[lr]::
8351::$$$message_0059_0019_0002$$$::"Mrgh, that's not bad either, but the cultural festival is the priority this time. With the knowledge of an executive committee member, I have to patiently explain what I know.[lr]::
8352::$$$message_0059_0019_0003$$$::...Well anyway, that's from tomorrow. I shall turn a blind eye for the sake of the obanyaki today."::
8353::$$$message_0059_0020_0000$$$::...Shoot, I forgot again.[lr]::
8354::$$$message_0059_0020_0001$$$::I ended up going home with Issei like this because Mitsuzuri got mad at me in the first place.[lr]::
8355::$$$message_0059_0020_0002$$$::"...Man, I'm forgetful..."[lr]::
8356::$$$message_0059_0020_0003$$$::Especially when it comes to the cultural festival.[lr]::
8357::$$$message_0059_0020_0004$$$::It's almost as if...[lr]::
8358::$$$message_0059_0020_0005$$$::I'm intentionally trying not to think about it.::
8359::$$$message_0059_0021_0000$$$::"...But well, I guess it's good I remembered.[lr]::
8360::$$$message_0059_0021_0001$$$::I'll do my best with a fresh mindset starting tomorrow, Issei."[lr]::
8361::$$$message_0059_0021_0002$$$::"Yeah, I'm counting on you. There's a ton of things you can help out with when it comes to the cultural festival. Let's see..."[lr]::
8362::$$$message_0059_0021_0003$$$::Issei says, as he puts three obanyakis inside my bag.::
8363::$$$message_0059_0022_0000$$$::"Think of this as the upfront payment."[lr]::
8364::$$$message_0059_0022_0001$$$::"It's not like I'm working for obanyaki."[lr]::
8365::$$$message_0059_0022_0002$$$::"Well, it's not good to reject donations. I'm always causing you some kind of trouble after all."::
8366::$$$message_0059_0023_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=一成01b腕(中) textoff=0]Issei nods in agreement with himself.[lr]::
8367::$$$message_0059_0023_0001$$$::It's like it's a given that I have to help him out if Issei is struggling, or rather, it's already become a routine...[lr]::
8368::$$$message_0059_0023_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=一成01a(中) textoff=0]Well, I'm also not insensitive enough to return this right back to him.::
8369::$$$message_0059_0024_0000$$$::"...I see, well I'll accept this as an offering then."[lr]::
8370::$$$message_0059_0024_0001$$$::"Hahaha, the great god Emiya, huh...? That's right, [cacheimage storage=一成03a(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=一成03a(中) time=300 textoff=0]speaking of offerings and deity incarnation, do you know about this?"[lr]::
8371::$$$message_0059_0024_0002$$$::Issei must want to show off his knowledge, as he begins to talk.[lr]::
8372::$$$message_0059_0024_0003$$$::Of course there's no way I would know, so I shake my head.::
8373::$$$message_0059_0025_0000$$$::"A long time ago, there was this dragon god in this river, and there was this ritual to placate the god in ancient times." [lr]::
8374::$$$message_0059_0025_0001$$$::"Wow, I didn't know... Were there things about the dragon gods and so on in the ritual of the fall festival?"[lr]::
8375::$$$message_0059_0025_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=一成01a(中) textoff=0]I go to the fall festival and the Tori no Ichi, a festival celebrating the coming of winter, at Ryudou Temple, but I've never heard of such an origin. Issei's family owns a temple, so he seems to be knowledgeable about ancient rituals.[lr]::
8376::$$$message_0059_0025_0003$$$::I nod, a sponge soaking in all manner of knowledge.::
8377::$$$message_0059_0026_0000$$$::"No, this has nothing to do with the religious festival we have now. The story goes that a monk from Ryudou Temple once used the power of Buddhism to calm and convert the raging dragon god after three days and nights of chanting and prayer. After he passed, the people of Miyama would honor his benevolence every fall..."[lr]::
8378::$$$message_0059_0026_0001$$$::...Wait, I remember hearing that there have only ever been a few people with such spiritual power at the temple.[lr]::
8379::$$$message_0059_0026_0002$$$::We don't really know what happened in the distant past. I bet lots of different traditions have been mixed up over time.::
8380::$$$message_0059_0027_0000$$$::"What's wrong? Was it boring, Emiya?"[lr]::
8381::$$$message_0059_0027_0001$$$::"No, it's interesting. But... There's a dragon god in this river, huh?"[lr]::
8382::$$$message_0059_0027_0002$$$::I don't feel any presence even if I stare at the surface of the river.[lr]::
8383::$$$message_0059_0027_0003$$$::Most of all, I feel like it would be difficult for the dragon god to live in this muddy river now.::
8384::$$$message_0059_0028_0000$$$::"We should arrive soon...[cacheimage storage=一成02c(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=一成02c(中) textoff=0] Hm hm, smooth red bean paste sure is good..."[lr]::
8385::$$$message_0059_0028_0001$$$::"Are you going to give the rest as souvenirs for Mr. Reikan or Mr. Kuzuki?"[lr]::
8386::$$$message_0059_0028_0002$$$::I take a peek at the leftover obanyaki inside Issei's bag.[lr]::
8387::$$$message_0059_0028_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=一成03b(中) textoff=0]I have some left too, but if I split it equally by the number of people, well... On the other hand, the amount Issei has...::
8388::$$$message_0059_0029_0000$$$::"Darn. I would be grounded if my father found out that I blew my money on sweets. It can't be helped; Emiya, help me out."[lr]::
8389::$$$message_0059_0029_0001$$$::"Wait, are we going to eat them up here...? Okay fine, I could use some tea..."[lr]::
8390::$$$message_0059_0029_0002$$$::"Yes, I'm scared of steamed buns and tea at the mountain."[lr]::
8391::$$$message_0059_0029_0003$$$::"...I'll bring you refreshments, Issei."::

